    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d418">

                <pb facs="0539" n="431" sameAs="frus:frus1893/pg431"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Señor Cayetano Romero
                        to Mr. Foster.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Mexican Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1892-12-31"><hi rendition="#italic">December 31,
                        1892</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">My dear Mr. Foster</hi>: I received your little note
                    of this date, in reply to mine of the 28th of the closing month, in which you
                    acquaint me that you have infromed the Secretary of War of the suggestion, which
                    I took the liberty to make to you, of causing an investigation that might
                    explain the facts in regard to the detention of Mexican soldiers at San Ignacio,
                    Tex.</p>
                <p>I am, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">C. Romero.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
